<title>INDIA: India ACC rises 5.3 pct at Bombay bourse.</title>
<headline>India ACC rises 5.3 pct at Bombay bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian cement-maker ACC jumped 74.75 rupees, or 5.30 percent, to 1,486.0 rupees at the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the stock gained on active speculative buying aided by some heavy purchases by foreign funds.</p>
<p>Over 190,000 shares were traded at the BSE near the session's close. The stock was among the top market outperformers on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>At the National Stock Exchange, ACC rose 96.05 rupees to 1,492.0 with 679,595 shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
